              "name": "LEAWE1974"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I adjusted the recipe for 17 people, for a work pot-luck. I used a little less mustard and a little more BBQ sauce. And 3 packages of Little Smokies instead of franks. I also put them in a crock pot to slow cook for the 4 hours leading up to lunch. It was a hit! Everyone loved them! I came home with an empty pot!"
